        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_82f97029",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "曾有一位旅者曾拜访罗伊人的部族。旅者展示出的异象，证实了其与“巴德尔”的深厚联系。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_528e1641",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c3b11c97",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "旅者以此请求与当时的秘日六席对话。我们几乎从未与外界产生联系，关于是否答应这位旅者的请求，内部也有诸多不同的意见。而“巴德尔”与旅者的联系是如此深刻而不容忽视，我们不应将受其眷顾的存在拒绝于部族之外。最终，秘日六席决定向旅者发出会面的邀请。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f5b22a74",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "他们具体的谈话内容，当时的秘日六席并未誊录，只有关键的信息被保留下来：“巴德尔”本是为护送▇▇而生的存在。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1926814e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6d961918",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在“巴德尔”最后一次运输▇▇时，其与▇▇遭遇。在到达目标地点▇▇▇前，“巴德尔”已因与██的战斗身负重伤，此后仍与▇▇持续战斗，直至来到这片我们生息的土地。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_aa397377",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "即使这位旅者与“巴德尔”的联系确凿无疑，这些消息仍然在上层中造成了冲击。冲击过后，我们也不得不承认：这些信息与罗伊神话的段落相互印证，应相信其为真相——这即是“巴德尔”的起源。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_d1b1ffba",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在商议后，当时的秘日六席决定暂时封存这些消息。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f9aa34df",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a8b31276",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "如今，深空联合已开始运转，研究院正在逐渐触及“巴德尔”的本质。当时的旅者将“巴德尔”的来处告知于我等，或许正是需要我们在此刻将这些信息分享给各位。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 12,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 13,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1f15d8e2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "愿深空联合的计划能够顺利……愿照耀冰原的巨人再次起身。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_27c51a05",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "与昭日者的谈话总结",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_67ddfe09",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6238a4ee",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "与昭日者会谈后，研究院提出的猜想被确认。而其中与▇▇相关的信息，则引起了来自瑝珑的研究者们的注意。一批研究者据此展开了与▇▇再生相关的研究，但遗憾的是，▇▇▇体系至今也处在我们无法触碰与理解的维度。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_343dd4d5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在不久后，这项研究便被搁置了。目前我们的第一目标，仍然是研究出稳定的外源性共鸣方式，以确保隧者能够在▇▇到来时启动。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 18,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 19,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9f33cd2f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_dca4fc3e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "此外，谈话中提到的旅者，其下落不明。关于其身份的推断，也在一段时间后搁置。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1be3bd46",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "深空联合建立后，我们面临的挑战不止是学术上的，也有各方组织的渗透乃至于破坏。文明的阴影不止有鸣式一种，面对当前的危机，我们不得不允许一些小小的谜题继续存在。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    }
  ]
